{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36301","headline":"雪中寄薛郎中 · 方干","name":"雪中寄薛郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"野禽未觉巢枝仄，稚子先忧径竹摧。\n半夜忽明非月午，前庭旋释被春摧。\n碎花若入樽中去，清气应归笔底来。\n深拥红炉听仙乐，忍教愁坐画寒灰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36301.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36301","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}